        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="1347" n="1189" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1189"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Norwegian Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-06-07"><hi rendition="#italic">June 7,
                        1906</hi></date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 13.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that Maj.
                    William W. Gibson, U. S. Army, has been directed to attend Mr. Charles H.
                    Graves, ambassador extraordinary, on special mission to represent the United
                    States at the coronation of King Haakon of Norway, as military assistant, and
                    that Lieut. Commander John H. Gibbons, U. S. Navy, has been selected for the
                    same service as naval assistant.</p>
                <p>I beg that you will do me the favor to notify your Government of these
                    selections.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
